(7443911, 1177131, 157179, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favourites. This centred composition really works with all those lines and the curved railing.<br/> <br/>If I wanted to be really picky, I would comment on the very top left-hand side of the image where we see a glimpse of a darkened area. A slightly tighter crop may have fixed that OR you may have been able to clone the colour of the beam, in that area.<br/> <br/>I understand that it is natural and it''s only my pickiness that''s talking, so I wouldn''t worry too much about it.<br/> <br/>Good work. Well done.</td>', 'This is one of my favourites. This centred composition really works with all those lines and the curved railing. If I wanted to be really picky, I would comment on the very top left-hand side of the image where we see a glimpse of a darkened area. A slightly tighter crop may have fixed that OR you may have been able to clone the colour of the beam, in that area. I understand that it is natural and it''s only my pickiness that''s talking, so I wouldn''t worry too much about it. Good work. Well done.', '2016-03-13 05:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
