(7444348, 1177187, 114285, '<td valign="top">Excellent choice to wear red on this very day, it always pops! Somewhere in Iceland maybe? Looks like a very exciting adventure anyway,   I really love the way the water looks so silky compared to the texture of the icy roof,  front page stuff for sure.</td>', 'Excellent choice to wear red on this very day, it always pops! Somewhere in Iceland maybe? Looks like a very exciting adventure anyway,   I really love the way the water looks so silky compared to the texture of the icy roof,  front page stuff for sure.', '2016-03-15 01:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
